{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://agent-cost-analyzer/views.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://agent-cost-analyzer/views.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Answers \"what did this project cost, where did the money go?\" for one project id from list_projects: everything get_repository_cost returns for the project's turns, plus a breakdown by repository member, by vendor then model, tokens per model by type (uncached input, cache write, cache read, reasoning, output) and the most expensive sessions. Defaults: monthly buckets, the preferred basis, prices as of use, native currencies. Returns totals per basis with coverage (knownTurns of turns), one point per bucket in the range (UTC; a bucket with turns but nothing known has usd null and no amounts: a gap, never 0) with a running total, a breakdown by vendor then model, and the documented price changes in the range for the models priced (priceChanges). Turns are bucketed by their own date; sessions are selected by their start. Local repositories are named by folder only. Cost figures carry their basis: billed (what GitHub Copilot billed, AI Credits), reported (what the agent logged itself, USD) and priced (tokens \u00d7 the price version in force on the turn's channel at the turn's time; see get_price_book, and priceVersionIds). The preferred figure is billed, else reported, else priced. A priced figure with apiEquivalent: true is what the same use costs on the API, though a flat-fee plan may have covered it. A priced figure with userPriceVersionIds used price versions the user added themselves (not bundled prices); say so when you quote it. An unknown figure is {known:false, reason}, never 0; totals give knownTurns of turns per basis. Currencies stay apart; `usd` converts only at 1 AI Credit = $0.01.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"basis":{"description":"Which cost basis the figures use: \"preferred\" (default: billed, else reported, else priced per turn), or only \"billed\", \"reported\" or \"priced\".","enum":["preferred","billed","reported","priced"],"type":"string"},"bucket":{"description":"Bucket size: \"day\", \"week\" (ISO weeks) or \"month\" (default), in UTC.","enum":["day","week","month"],"type":"string"},"currency":{"description":"\"native\" (default): each figure in its own unit (AI Credits or USD), totals per currency. \"usd\": everything in USD at 1 AI Credit = $0.01, the only conversion used.","enum":["native","usd"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"How many of the most recent sessions to read per provider (default 50, max 500).","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":500,"type":"integer"},"pricing":{"description":"How priced figures are priced: \"as-of-use\" (default: the price in force when each turn ran) or \"today\" (every turn at today's prices, for comparing and estimating).","enum":["as-of-use","today"],"type":"string"},"projectId":{"description":"Project id from list_projects.","pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,63}$","type":"string"},"provider":{"description":"Restrict to one log provider id (see list_log_providers). Default: every available provider.","type":"string"},"since":{"description":"First day, inclusive: \"YYYY-MM-DD\" (UTC). Sessions started earlier are not read.","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"topSessions":{"description":"How many of the most expensive sessions to return (default 10, max 50).","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"until":{"description":"Last day, inclusive: \"YYYY-MM-DD\" (UTC).","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"}},"required":["projectId"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_project_cost","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"basis":{"enum":["preferred","billed","reported","priced"],"type":"string"},"bucket":{"enum":["day","week","month"],"type":"string"},"byRepository":{"i